# Roboter Studio manual control — replay a recorded hand-guided trajectory on
# the REAL follower. Points come from `points_json` (inline, CONTRACT B) OR — when
# empty — from a server-persisted trajectory named `name`. `speed` is a playback
# multiplier (clamped). SAFETY: the recorded timestamps are NOT published raw ×
# speed; each consecutive pair is re-segmented through the quintic velocity floor
# (build_segment) so playback can never exceed the safe per-joint velocity — a
# ×2 becomes "≤×2, clamped where unsafe". A velocity-safe lead-in from the arm's
# current pose is prepended. Runs asynchronously (the callback returns a
# "started" ack); the follower is re-torqued ON before any motion.
string name
string points_json
float32 speed
---
bool success
string message
